# Complete semantic translation of the historical standalone usbprn.wlcmd.
#
# The eight historical callbacks and entry points are automatic roots because
# their addresses escape through operation vectors, request callbacks, or
# hotplug registration.  The seven bus_ops mappings to warlock_dummy cannot
# affect usbprn, whose dev_ops has no bus_ops vector.
#
# OSLL produces identical analysis and function inventories with and without
# "one usbprn_state".  New locklint already distinguishes concrete object
# identities and needs no declaration for this focused module.
